ized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017490913","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369#issuecomment-4017490913","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110369","id":4017490913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vdgvh","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T22:02:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T22:04:21Z","body":"> We discussed this at the animation meeting, but it was difficult to find consensus.\r\n\r\nTo clarify, the main concern was likely compatibility issues.\r\n\r\nIn older projects, for example, when a parameter like `BlendSpace2D/3/blend_position` existed, after deleting a point, its path would be automatically changed to `BlendSpace2D/2/blend_position`. However, there should be agreement that this \"automatic path change behavior is inconvenient.\"\r\n\r\nWhile scripts based on this automatic path change behavior (though I believe this is a niche case) will break compatibility, I believe the migration path is secure as demonstrated above using `get_blend_point_name()`. Except for that niche case, no migration is required as long as `disable_deprecated` is `false`.\r\n\r\nEven without this, it might not prevent you from making games, but since it's inconvenient that we can't assign arbitrary names to nested BlendTrees like `BlendSpace2D/NestedBlendSpace2D/blend_position`, I suggest to merge this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017490913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4047098983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110369#issuecomment-4047098983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110369","id":4047098983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7xOdRn","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-12T14:13:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T14:13:41Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR